===============================================================================
Upstream: MetalDock
===============================================================================

metaldock-vwf packages a refactored form of the MetalDock metal-organic
docking pipeline as visual workflow nodes:

    MetalDock: An Open-Source Docking Tool for Metal-Organic Compounds.
    M. Hakkennes et al.
    J. Chem. Inf. Model. 2023. doi:10.1021/acs.jcim.3c01582
    https://github.com/MatthijsHak/MetalDock
    Distributed under the MIT License.

The scientific modules under _vendor/metaldock_modules/ are a refactored
(pure-function) reimplementation of the MetalDock pipeline. Node integration
(*/node.py, */meta.toml) is original metal-docking work.

===============================================================================
Bundled demonstration data
===============================================================================

The demo_data/ directories carry the inputs for the 1JZI Re case so the shipped
workflow template runs with nothing to download:

  - mdock_protein_prep/demo_data/1jzi.pdb
    Azurin from Pseudomonas aeruginosa, RCSB Protein Data Bank entry 1JZI.
    PDB structure data are released without restriction (CC0-equivalent); cite
    the depositors and the PDB when reusing them.

  - mdock_ligand_prep/demo_data/1jzi_D_REP.xyz
    mdock_results_analysis/demo_data/1jzi_D_REP.xyz
    The Re(phen)(CO)3(His83) complex geometry, taken from the MetalDock
    repository's example_runs (MIT License; see Upstream above).

  - mdock_qm_charges/demo_data/1jzi_re_orca_reference_graph.json
    CM5 charges and bond orders for the same complex computed with ORCA 6.1 in
    this project, kept as the accuracy reference the default xtb engine is
    compared against. Original to metal-docking.

  - Intermediate artefacts, so that each node can also be run on its own rather
    than only as a link in the chain. All are outputs of a real run of this
    pipeline on the two inputs above, not fabricated files; original to
    metal-docking:
      mdock_qm_charges/demo_data/1jzi_D_REP_c.xyz
      mdock_qm_charges/demo_data/1jzi_re_mol_graph.json
      mdock_ligand_pdbqt/demo_data/1jzi_re_enriched_graph.json
      mdock_autodock_run/demo_data/1jzi_re_enriched_graph.json
      mdock_autodock_run/demo_data/1jzi_re_ligand.pdbqt
      mdock_autodock_run/demo_data/clean_1jzi.pdbqt

